{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_117_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_117","textTraditional":"一、三年，春，王正月，郊牛之口傷。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_117_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_117","textTraditional":"之口，緩辭也，傷自牛作也。改卜牛，牛死，乃不郊，事之變也。乃者，亡乎人之辭也。猶三望。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_117_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_117","textTraditional":"二、葬匡王。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_117_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_117","textTraditional":"三、楚子伐陸渾戎。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_117_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_117","textTraditional":"四、夏，楚人侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_117_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_117","textTraditional":"五、秋，赤狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_117_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_117","textTraditional":"六、宋師圍曹。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_117_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_117","textTraditional":"七、冬，十月，丙戌，鄭伯蘭卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_117_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_117","textTraditional":"八、葬鄭穆公。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}